menu "CDP Debug Server"

config CDP
    bool "Chrome DevTools Protocol server over WiFi"
    depends on WIFI && WIFI_LWIP
    default n
    help
      Embeds a minimal CDP (Chrome DevTools Protocol) server in the
      firmware. Listens on a TCP port over WiFi. Chrome DevTools or
      Playwright can connect via WebSocket to inspect memory, read
      audio metrics, send MIDI, and stream logs.

config CDP_PORT
    int "CDP TCP listen port"
    depends on CDP
    default 9222

endmenu
